---
import LeafMark from "./LeafMark.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Atmospheric background washes -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none">
    <div
      class="absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-160 h-160 rounded-full opacity-40 blur-3xl drift"
      style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(143,198,223,0.55), transparent 60%);"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute top-[35%] -left-40 w-130 h-130 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl"
      style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(46,179,155,0.35), transparent 60%);"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-310 mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 md:pb-32">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rise" style="animation-delay: 60ms;">
      <span class="w-8 h-px bg-leaf-deep"></span>
      <span class="eyebrow">Valencia · Online · ES / EN</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main editorial grid: headline left, sidebar right -->
    <div class="mt-8 md:mt-12 grid grid-cols-12 gap-y-12 gap-x-8 items-end">
      <!-- Headline column -->
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8">
        <h1
          class="font-display text-[2.6rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] md:text-[4.6rem] lg:text-[5.6rem] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink rise"
          style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 30, 'wght' 400; animation-delay: 140ms;"
        >
          Liderar con
          <span class="block">
            <span
              class="font-display-italic text-deep"
              style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 100, 'WONK' 1, 'wght' 380;"
            >
              coherencia
            </span>
            <span class="inline-block translate-y-[-0.05em] mx-1 text-leaf"
              >·</span
            >
            claridad.
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-[1.08rem] md:text-[1.18rem] leading-[1.65] text-ink-muted rise"
          style="animation-delay: 280ms;"
        >
          Coaching integrativo para
          <span class="text-ink">mujeres profesionales</span>
          y <span class="text-ink">equipos TIC</span> que quieren tomar decisiones
          alineadas con sus valores —
          <em class="font-display-italic text-deep"
            >sin culpa, sin ruido, sin perderse en el camino</em
          >.
        </p>

        <div
          class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 rise"
          style="animation-delay: 420ms;"
        >
          <a href="#guia" class="btn btn-primary">
            Descargar la guía gratuita
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-ghost">
            Sesión de exploración · 40 min
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tiny meta line under CTAs -->
        <div
          class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[0.82rem] text-ink-soft rise"
          style="animation-delay: 540ms;"
        >
          <span class="tick">Sin compromiso</span>
          <span class="tick">Online por videollamada</span>
          <span class="tick">Adherido al código EMCC</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar editorial card -->
      <aside
        class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 lg:pl-6 lg:border-l lg:border-rule rise"
        style="animation-delay: 360ms;"
      >
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <LeafMark size={36} />
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Una nota</p>
            <p
              class="mt-3 font-display text-[1.35rem] leading-[1.35] text-ink"
              style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 24, 'SOFT' 60;"
            >
              <span class="font-display-italic">"</span>De la tecnología a las
              personas. Del código a la
              <span class="font-display-italic text-leaf-deep">coherencia.</span
              >
              <span class="font-display-italic">"</span>
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 eyebrow">— Mauricio Magni · Coach integrativo</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hairline mt-8"></div>

        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[0.95rem] text-ink-muted">
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="numeral text-[1.05rem]">01</span>
            <span>35 años en tecnología y liderazgo de equipos</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="numeral text-[1.05rem]">02</span>
            <span>Itinerario completo en coaching · Fundares</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="numeral text-[1.05rem]">03</span>
            <span>Máster en coaching y neurociencia <em>en curso</em></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom marker line -->
    <div class="mt-20 md:mt-28 flex items-end justify-between gap-6 reveal">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
        <span class="font-display-italic text-leaf-deep text-[1.1rem]">
          Empezar
        </span>
        <span class="hairline w-32 md:w-64 mb-1.5"></span>
      </div>
      <span class="eyebrow hidden sm:inline">↓ &nbsp; Bajar</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
